          "#f": 1
        }
      ],
      "baptist": [
        [
          "^A grim night. A dance, a drunken promise, and a head on a platter. Herod didn't want to do it—he feared the man—but he feared his guests more. Now he thinks Jesus is John come back from the grave.",
          "\n",
          "ev",
          "str",
          "^And when Jesus arrived?",
          "/str",
          "/ev",
          {
            "*": ".^.c-0",
            "flg": 20
          },
          {
            "c-0": [
              "^ ",
              {
                "->": "jesus_meeting"
              },
