              "\n",
              {
                "#f": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        {
          "#f": 1
        }
      ],
      "closing": [
        [
          "^My wife, Joanna, is out there somewhere following Him. She saw the healing power Herod so desperately wanted to consume for sport. I stay here, in a palace built on blood. Go quickly—the guards are returning.",
          "\n",
          "done",
          {
            "#f": 1
